### Per-Game HTML Pattern (data/)
Most games follow: game_X_setup.html → game_X_names.html (optional) → game_X_run.html
- setup: Configure parameters, select players, load game via /api/game/load?id=N
- names: Assign player names to puck positions (optional page)
- run: Live dashboard polling /api/game/status, send commands via /api/game/action

