## COMMON PATTERNS

### Game Base Class (Game.h)
All games inherit from Game and implement:
- setup() — called once when game starts
- loop() — called every main loop iteration
- handleEvent(puckIndex, EventPacket) — on puck button press
- processCommand(cmd, value) — web API commands
- getStatusJSON() — returns JSON string for frontend polling
- getName() — returns game name string

### Typical Game State Machine
SETUP → WAIT_HANDS (optional hold-to-start) → COUNTDOWN (3s, SKI sound) → RUNNING → FINISHED

### Communication Protocol
- Coordinator → Puck: CommandPacket (cmd, effectID, r,g,b, duration, extra, seqNr)
- Puck → Coordinator: EventPacket (type, battery_mv, version, seqNr, temp_c10)
- Deduplication via seqNr on both directions
- Pucks send 3x, coordinator sends 3x (reliability on lossy ESP-NOW)

### Effect IDs (Common.h EffectID enum)
0=OFF, 1=STATIC, 2=BLINK, 3=BREATHE, 4=BREATHE_MOD2, 5=BREATHE_MOD4,
6=SINGLE_CHASE, 7=DOUBLE_CHASE, 8=SPLIT_ROT, 9=RAINBOW, 10=COUNTDOWN,
11=LOADING, 12=WIN, 13=FAIL, 14=FLASH, 15=SPARKLE, 16=POLICE,
17=STATUS, 18=PROGRESS, 19=BLINK_COUNT, 20=FLASH_BEEP

### Sound Sequence IDs (Common.h SoundSeqID enum)
0=OFF, 1=FANFARE, 2=ERROR, 3=EXPLOSION, 4=HERO, 5=MARIO, 6=TETRIS,
7=RACE, 8=SKI, 9=DINGDONG

### Event Types (Common.h EventType enum)
0=HELLO, 1=HEARTBEAT, 10=BTN_CLICK, 11=BTN_HOLD, 12=BTN_DOUBLE, 20=BTN_RELEASE

### License System (ActivationManager)
- FREE: 20h playtime limit
- EXTENDED: 80h (key: TIME-<devicecode><salt> → CRC32 → 9 digits)
- FULL: unlimited (key: FULL-<devicecode><salt> → CRC32 → 9 digits)
- Debug mode: /register.html?debug=1 allows minute-level time limits
- CRC32: ~esp_rom_crc32_le(~0U, data, len) matches Python zlib.crc32()